<view class="container">
  <view class="hero card">
    <view class="badge">豆仓助手</view>
    <view class="title">把图片变成拼豆图纸</view>
    <view class="subtitle">
      导入图片，选择 32 / 48 / 64 / 128 尺寸，自动匹配色号并统计库存缺口。
    </view>
    <button class="primary-btn" bindtap="goCreate">创建图纸</button>
    <button class="secondary-btn" bindtap="createDemo">快速体验示例图</button>
  </view>

  <view class="quick-grid">
    <view class="card quick-card" bindtap="goPatterns">
      <view class="quick-title">我的图纸</view>
      <view class="quick-desc">查看、重命名、复制和删除已保存图纸。</view>
      <view class="quick-link">打开 ›</view>
    </view>

    <view class="card quick-card" bindtap="goInventory">
      <view class="quick-title">拼豆库存</view>
      <view class="quick-desc">维护每个色号数量，自动计算缺豆数量。</view>
      <view class="quick-link">管理 ›</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card" wx:if="{{recentPatterns.length}}">
    <view class="recent-head">
      <view class="section-title">最近图纸</view>
      <view class="all-link" bindtap="goPatterns">查看全部</view>
    </view>
    <view
      class="pattern-item"
      wx:for="{{recentPatterns}}"
      wx:key="id"
      data-id="{{item.id}}"
      bindtap="openPattern"
    >
      <view>
        <view class="pattern-name">{{item.name}}</view>
        <view class="pattern-meta">{{item.size}} × {{item.size}} · {{item.brand}}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="arrow">›</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="notice">
    当前色卡为 DEMO 演示数据，不代表任何品牌官方色号。后续替换真实品牌色卡时，算法、编辑器和库存结构无需改动。
  </view>
</view>
